                <pb facs="0427" n="313" sameAs="frus:frus1924v01/pg313"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">375.1123 Coleman and De Long/89: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Albania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Kodding</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tirana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-10-10T16:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 10,
                                1924—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received October 11—3:52
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>78. Your 48, September 22, 4 p.m.<anchor n="9" xml:id="d260-f1"/> There is no
                    improvement in the weakened position of the Albanian head of State and Cabinet,
                    which Legation indicated in its 71, September 16, 8 a.m., and despatch 327 of
                    September 20.<anchor n="9a" xml:id="d260-f2"/> Both the Prime Minister and
                    Finance Minister remain abroad. An example of the failure to assure public
                    safety is the throwing of a rock yesterday into the state hospital here. Our
                    expectations as to action regarding the murder of the Americans have not been
                    fulfilled.</p>
                <p>I do not believe that it will serve American interests to take up formal
                    relations at present with the Nationalist regime, in view of all the facts and
                    considering that Greece is the only nation represented here which is not
                    reserving recognition for a more favorable time.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kodding</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
